 "notes": "MySQL roles share native account identities. Users retains every account for policy editing. Roles provides action aliases for all named accounts and reports observed role usage separately; CREATE ROLE origin is not attested by the native catalog. Creation, initial members and partial native failure qualify through both connectors and authenticated APIs. Shared rendering and round trips remain pending. Users: Native account operations use the production owner/endpoint/operation-scoped protected-result service. Generation requires unlocked master-password storage or configured worker keys. Shared reveal/recovery presentation remains unsurfaced; Decision10 still excludes raw user-key export. Merged 2026-11-05 with the user and privilege forms (the descriptor service serves one form per family); a privilege shows read-only, since grants and revokes are the typed grant/revoke operations."
